msgid "Operating Analysis"
msgstr "公司经营分析"

msgid "Company-wide analysis"
msgstr "公司整体分析"

msgid "Official invoices, factory purchase orders and registered administrative expenses."
msgstr "基于正式医院发票、工厂采购单与已登记行政支出。"

msgid "Back to financial actuals"
msgstr "返回财务实绩"

msgid "Reporting month"
msgstr "统计月份"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "筛选"

msgid "Company-wide EUR estimates based on currently registered documents and expenses. VAT, income tax, depreciation, bank charges, unrecorded costs and accounting period adjustments may not be fully covered."
msgstr "公司整体 EUR 经营估算基于当前已登记单据和费用，可能未完整覆盖增值税、所得税、折旧、银行手续费、未登记成本和会计期间调整。"

msgid "Sales and purchases use account issue dates; administrative expenses use expense dates. Cash flow uses transaction payment dates and administrative payment dates, including payments for earlier months."
msgstr "销售和采购按结算账户开立日期统计，行政支出按费用发生日期统计；现金流按流水付款日期和行政费用付款日期统计，包含以前月份费用的本月付款。"

msgid "Administrative payment status is manually registered. The cash flow estimate is not a bank-reconciled cash balance. Administrative expenses are not allocated to hospitals or orders."
msgstr "行政费用付款状态为人工登记；净现金流估算不代表经银行对账的现金余额。行政支出不分摊到医院或订单。"

msgid "Sales and factory purchases"
msgstr "销售与工厂采购"

msgid "Company operating estimate"
msgstr "公司经营估算"

msgid "Registered cash flow"
msgstr "已登记现金流"

msgid "Hospital invoiced sales"
msgstr "医院开票销售额"

msgid "Factory purchases"
msgstr "工厂采购额"

msgid "Estimated gross profit"
msgstr "预计毛利润"

msgid "Estimated gross margin"
msgstr "预计毛利率"

msgid "Company administrative expenses"
msgstr "公司行政支出"

msgid "Estimated operating balance"
msgstr "预计经营结余"

msgid "Estimated operating margin"
msgstr "预计经营结余率"

msgid "Registered hospital receipts"
msgstr "医院登记收款"

msgid "Registered factory payments"
msgstr "工厂登记付款"

msgid "Paid administrative expenses"
msgstr "行政费用已付款"

msgid "Estimated net cash inflow"
msgstr "净现金流估算"

msgid "Operating trends"
msgstr "经营趋势"

msgid "Cash flow trends"
msgstr "现金流趋势"

msgid "Administrative expenses by category"
msgstr "行政费用分类汇总"

msgid "Expense date basis; voided expenses excluded."
msgstr "按费用发生日期统计，排除作废记录。"

msgid "Category"
msgstr "一级分类"

msgid "Subcategory"
msgstr "二级分类"

msgid "Amount (EUR)"
msgstr "金额（EUR）"

msgid "Share of administrative expenses"
msgstr "占行政支出比例"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "详情"

msgid "View category"
msgstr "查看分类记录"

msgid "Show subcategories"
msgstr "展开二级分类"

msgid "Monthly figures for the displayed trends"
msgstr "查看趋势月度数据"

msgid "Month"
msgstr "月份"

msgid "Generated at"
msgstr "数据生成时间"

msgid "Chart series"
msgstr "图表指标"

msgid "Select a legend item to show or hide a series. Hover over the chart for exact monthly amounts; the monthly figures below also include every series."
msgstr "点击图例可显示或隐藏指标；悬停查看精确月度金额，下方月度数据包含全部指标。"

msgid "Choose a month that supports a complete 12-month reporting period."
msgstr "请选择支持完整 12 个月统计区间的月份。"

msgid "Choose exactly one reporting month."
msgstr "请仅选择一个统计月份。"

